SUMMARY:The Invite (2026)
LOCATION:The Marquee\, Union South
DESCRIPTION:USA | 107 Mins | R | Dir. Olivia Wilde\n \nJoe and Angela's m
 arriage is on thin ice. When they invite their enigmatic upstairs neighbo
 rs for a dinner party\, the night spirals into unexpected places. Have th
 ey reignited the spark or lit the match that burns it all down?-Rotten To
 matoes\n \n"The performances are impeccable\, the characters impossibly 
 well balanced. Wilde the film-maker is unimpeachable here."-Kevin Maher f
 or The Times\n\n \nWatch the trailer here: https://www.youtube.com/watch
 ?v=OJ19I9q_hOQ \n \n\n \n\n \n \nFor information on available assist
 ive content for WUD Film screenings\, please visit the Assistive Movie Sc
 reenings in the Marquee Theater page.  \nVisit our Informed Moviegoing 
 Resources page for links to resources that explore film ratings and conte
 nt alerts.\nThis event is intended for UW-Madison students\, faculty\, st
 aff\, Wisconsin Union members and their guests. Anyone can become a Wisco
 nsin Union member.\n\nhttps://union.wisc.edu/events-and-activities/event-
 calendar/event/wud-film-presents-invite-2026-0\n\nSource: WUD Film (The M
 arquee)
URL:https://union.wisc.edu/events-and-activities/event-calendar/event/wud-
 film-presents-invite-2026-0
